SWEEP — a tale from the mountain
Style: 80s Cel Anime (Lemo-Opuscar style library). Story, characters, picture, score and sound design are original;
no characters, names, scenes, designs or music from any existing film.

Picture: drawn entirely in code (Canvas2D cels and painted plates → WebGL2 tape + CRT pass, adapted from the library's
80s Cel Anime engine: cel.js, post.js, fx.js). No generated images, no stock footage.

Voices: Kokoro TTS (kokoro-onnx, Apache-2.0 model weights), voices bm_fable, am_onyx, af_nicole; pitch-shifted per character.
  (ElevenLabs takes can replace them line for line: SCRIPT_ELEVENLABS.md)
Music and foley: synthesised in code (numpy), original.

